    "body": "Because `get_uid()` spawns a new process, let's try and make that the last check in this series of checks.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n    if user != logname || ssh_connection.is_some() || is_root() {\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn this example, `is_root()` would perform the full uid check so that we don't need to `get_uid()` if either of the other two are successful. You can maybe also change the module color within that function.",
